{
    "title": "How to leave this world",
    "data": {
        "stitches": {
            "aTeacherYesThats": {
                "content": [
                    "A teacher… Yes, that’s what I do for a living. I’ve been doing it for two years now, but it feels like a century… Thank God today’s over.",
                    {
                        "option": "Go straight to the pub",
                        "linkPath": "veryGoodAfterEnd",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "option": "Go back to school and finish what‘s necessary",
                        "linkPath": "youAreRightWritt",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "option": "(letter instructions)",
                        "linkPath": "chooseANumberFro",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "option": "(Emile)",
                        "linkPath": "emileIsTheOnlySt",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "pageNum": 1
                    }
                ]
            },
            "veryGoodAfterEnd": {
                "content": [
                    "Very good. After endless hours of explaining things no one seems to understand, my throat is dry, and having a few beers sounds like the best thing to do.",
                    {
                        "option": "„Three Cats“",
                        "linkPath": "byFourOclockTheP",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "youAreRightWritt": {
                "content": [
                    "You are right. Written assignments are piling up on my desk and even though I feel sick about having to read it, ",
                    {
                        "option": "And maybe…",
                        "linkPath": "maybeThereIsStil",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "emileIsTheOnlySt": {
                "content": [
                    "Emile is the only student who makes me feel it‘s not completely for nothing what I am doing. He tries to understand what I am trying to explain, his results in the exams prove that he is good and I don‘t spoil it. He was the only one who really passed the last algebra test last week. I let the most of the others pass too, but Emile deserves that.",
                    {
                        "option": "How can I help you?",
                        "linkPath": "emileApprochesMe",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "byFourOclockTheP": {
                "content": [
                    "By four o’clock, the pub ‘Three Cats’ is already almost full. The low-ceilinged room is thick with cigarette smoke and the smell of burnt grease from the kitchen. Several people inside beckon me with conspiratorial, insincere smiles.",
                    {
                        "option": "Right to my table",
                        "linkPath": "todayAreThereKou",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "maybeThereIsStil": {
                "content": [
                    "Maybe there is still Nadia working in the staffroom, preparing lessons for the next day.",
                    {
                        "option": "Why would you care?",
                        "linkPath": "nadiaIsTheOnlyCo",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "option": "Is it worth it?",
                        "linkPath": "toTalkToNadiaWou",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "emileApprochesMe": {
                "content": [
                    "Emile approches me and greets. I can see that he wants to ask me someting different than other times when he has a question about the stuff from our lesson. He doesn‘t know how to start or even whether it was a good idea to ask me at all.",
                    {
                        "option": "Just wait",
                        "linkPath": "justWaitingMyFac",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "todayAreThereKou": {
                "content": [
                    "Today are there Koulouch and Barta, empty chair is waiting for me. Barta deals the cards and bets are placed. First game goes to me, then the luck changes and I am loosing quite a lot. But it‘s worth it. Probably the only moment when I feel emotions and exitement. During the game I forget about dullness and emptiness of the days. ",
                    {
                        "option": "Leave",
                        "linkPath": "okThatsEnoughFor",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    },
                    {
                        "option": "Stay",
                        "linkPath": "evenThoughIFeelD",
                        "ifConditions": null,
                        "notIfConditions": null
                    }
                ]
            },
            "nadiaIsTheOnlyCo": {
                "content": [
                    "Nadia is the only college who I like to talk to. About same age like me, teaching history, quiet, calm, doesn't seek contact with others. maybe with the exception of me. (or is it just wishful thinking?)"
                ]
            },
            "toTalkToNadiaWou": {
                "content": [
                    "To talk to Nadia would help me to feel a bit better. But maybe there are other colleges which would cause the opposite."
                ]
            },
            "justWaitingMyFac": {
                "content": [
                    "Just waiting, my face should express that if he changes his mind and walks away, it‘s completely fine with me. Then he opens his bag and reaches me a notebook. Looks similar we use, I take it, a bit surprised why he hesitated to show me his notes. Regarding the notebook a bit closer, it looks similar to ours, but older. It smells older… But on the top page is his name: „Emile Bernard“, so why he looks so nerveous?",
                    {
                        "divert": "heGuessesWhatIAm"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "heGuessesWhatIAm": {
                "content": [
                    "He guesses what I am thinking about and say: „It‘s my grandfather Emile, not me. Would you please have a look whether it makes sens to you?“"
                ]
            },
            "okThatsEnoughFor": {
                "content": [
                    "Ok, that‘s enough for today. I get up with the quiet sigh and say „See you tomorrow“."
                ]
            },
            "evenThoughIFeelD": {
                "content": [
                    "Even though I feel drunk and already loosing more money than ususal, I order another beer and deal the cards."
                ]
            },
